# LibreChat + Nexus

Configure Nexus as an OpenAPI/action/tool provider if supported by your LibreChat
deployment:

```text
OpenAPI: {NEXUS_URL}/.well-known/nexus/openapi.json
Header:  Authorization: Bearer ${NEXUS_SECRET}
```

Recommended enabled operations:

- save memory
- recall memory
- reflect over memory
- get agent context
